    "body": "Merged `main` (1a882e5) to clear the conflict in `operation/material.rs`: `detect_holes` stays, and `named_material` takes main's setup-frame signature (#326). `holes_of` / `cross_holes_of` (which `detect_holes` calls) are unchanged.\n\nRe-ran on the merge from a clean build (the new MCP test listed as compiled). For a change to `operation/material.rs` the quick gate's plan now spans the post, sim, motion (`posed_subtract`), app and ui suites: 1929 pass, 20 ignored, 3 fail. The 3 failures are the three ui pixel snapshots, by the same counts as clean `main` on this machine (1544, 1815, 2080). `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean. Marking ready for review.",
